@khorsheed/dsh-ankh-guard README · 安装：在 DSH 的「插件 → 添加插件」里输入下面的包名，点安装：

```
@khorsheed/dsh-ankh-guard
```

它也随「开发套件」（`@khorsheed/dsh-dev-suite`）一起提供。装好后让 agent 照着随包的「安全重启」说明操作就行。

@khorsheed/dsh-ankh-guard README · 用之前要准备好：- **部署目录是一个 git 仓库**：「测过了」的证明和退回旧版本都靠 git 记录。
- **agent 不受沙箱限制**：启动 DSH 时设 `DSH_PERMISSION_MODE=danger-full-access`，或在会话里输入 `/permission danger-full-access`，否则 agent 没法停止和拉起服务。
- **第一次重启交给命令行**：装好后先运行一次 `dsh-ankh-guard supervise`，把服务交给守卫看管；之后的重启 agent 自己就能完成。

@khorsheed/dsh-ankh-guard README · 已知限制：- 只管得了经过守卫的重启；绕开它手动停服务，仍可能把服务搞挂，这时由自动退回兜底。
- 服务崩溃（而不是正常停止）时，被打断的会话不会自动续上，要等你打开它时才恢复。
- 只支持 macOS 和 Linux。

@khorsheed/dsh-ankh-guard README · 给开发者：- 命令行 `dsh-ankh-guard` 的全部命令、自我重启的六步流程、watchdog 和 launchd / systemd 的部署方式、启动配置切换、各配置项，都在[完整参考](https://github.com/Khorsheed/dsh-plugins/blob/main/packages/ankh-guard/docs/reference.md)里。
- 入口：`src/index.ts`（应用内的服务和说明）、`src/cli.ts`（命令行）、`scripts/dsh-watchdog.sh`（watchdog）。
- 在 [dsh-plugins](https://github.com/Khorsheed/dsh-plugins) 开发，另有单插件镜像仓 [dsh-ankh-guard](https://github.com/Khorsheed/dsh-ankh-guard)；变更见 [CHANGELOG.md](CHANGELOG.md)。

@khorsheed/dsh-ankh-guard README · Install：In DSH, open Plugins → Add plugin, enter this package name, and press Install:

```
@khorsheed/dsh-ankh-guard
```

It also comes with the Dev Suite (`@khorsheed/dsh-dev-suite`). Once installed, have the agent follow the bundled "safe restart" guide.

@khorsheed/dsh-ankh-guard README · Before you start：- **The deployment directory is a git repository**: the "tests passed" proof and the fallback to an earlier version both rely on git.
- **The agent runs without a sandbox**: start DSH with `DSH_PERMISSION_MODE=danger-full-access`, or type `/permission danger-full-access` in the session; otherwise the agent cannot stop and start the service.
- **The first restart goes through the command line**: after installing, run `dsh-ankh-guard supervise` once to hand the service to the guard; from then on the agent can restart on its own.

@khorsheed/dsh-ankh-guard README · Known limitations：- It only covers restarts that go through the guard; stopping the service by hand can still break it, and the automatic fallback is the safety net there.
- After a crash (rather than a normal stop), interrupted sessions don't continue on their own; they recover when you open them.
- macOS and Linux only.

@khorsheed/dsh-ankh-guard README · For developers：- Every `dsh-ankh-guard` command, the six-step self-restart protocol, the watchdog and launchd / systemd deployment shapes, launch-config cutover and all configuration options are in the [full reference](https://github.com/Khorsheed/dsh-plugins/blob/main/packages/ankh-guard/docs/reference.en.md).
- Entry points: `src/index.ts` (the in-app service and guide), `src/cli.ts` (the CLI), `scripts/dsh-watchdog.sh` (the watchdog).
- Developed in [dsh-plugins](https://github.com/Khorsheed/dsh-plugins), with a single-plugin mirror at [dsh-ankh-guard](https://github.com/Khorsheed/dsh-ankh-guard). Changes: [CHANGELOG.md](CHANGELOG.md).
